  "status": "Pinned Firefox HTML text-label buttons use actual NSButton components and pass actual desktop pixels/input/recovery; full native browser/application integration remains incomplete.",
  "implementation": {
    "components": "Existing NativeUI/GNUstep NSButton; no copied widget, title renderer, whitespace rules, key bindings or CSS sizing solver.",
